# libmpv for the Windows build (headers, import library, runtime dll). It lives
# in the source tree so MPV_DIR defaults to it, but the dev kit is ~80 MB and is
# not tracked: drop a libmpv package in 3rdparty/mpv/ with
#   include/mpv/{client.h,render.h}, lib/x86_64/libmpv.dll.a, bin/libmpv-2.dll
